<title>USA: Omaha hogs off $1.00-1.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs off $1.00-1.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $1.00 to $1.25 lower. Top $58.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-250 lbs    58.50</p>
<p>Sows - not established.</p>
</text>
